      "date": "2026-10-27",
      "authors": [
        "Independent Researcher"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how physical telemetry signals can predict LLM cognitive collapse without inspecting generated text. You will learn how tracking latency and output variance enables deterministic context rollback in long-turn workflows.",
